  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This home is professionally managed by Beach Habitats 30a. <br><br>Step inside Sun-Kissed on Hickory, a beautifully designed coastal retreat in the heart of Old Seagrove Beach. Now available as a 30A vacation rental for the very first time, this spacious, light-filled home blends contemporary design with laid-back luxury—perfect for families or groups seeking comfort, style, and unbeatable access to 30A.<br><br>Spread across four thoughtfully planned levels, the home features:<br>~Private Courtyard + Heated Pool – Lounge or dine poolside in your private outdoor space.<br>~Designer Interiors – Bright, clean lines with layered textures, white-on-white décor, and custom finishes throughout.<br>~Multiple Living Areas – Three distinct lounges ensure space for everyone, including a downstairs media den and a third floor living space with wet bar, wine fridge, and mini fridge.<br>~Gourmet Kitchen – Outfitted with marble countertops and seating at both bar and dining table.<br>~Flexible Sleeping – Includes a main-floor king suite, bunk room with custom built-ins, and multiple upper-level king bedrooms with cozy reading nooks and built-in window benches.<br>~Gulf-View Tower + Porches – Take in coastal breezes and sunsets from over 700 sq. ft. of porches, including a top-floor deck with gulf views.<br>~Location Perfection – Just 75 steps from the sugar-white sand and less than a 5-minute walk to Seaside.<br><br>This home is ideal for guests looking for a high-end, serene experience in a truly walkable 30A location. With stylish decor, an abundance of natural light, and no prior rental wear-and-tear, Sun Kissed on Hickory delivers the charm of Old Seagrove with the comfort of a newly curated home.<br><br>HOME LAYOUT <br><br>1st Floor:<br>-Grand Entryway<br>-Den with couch + flat screen TV. <br>-King Bedroom<br>-Hallway Full Bathroom with Shower<br>-Bunk room with two Twin/Twin bunks<br><br>2nd Floor:<br>-Living Room + Flat Screen TV<br>-Dining Room<br>-Two Balconies! On open air and view of 30a + One screened in - perfect for morning coffee or evening cocktails.<br>-Primary King Bedroom, Ensuite with Shower & Tub<br><br>3rd Floor:<br>-King Bedroom + Twin daybed<br>-King Bedroom<br>-Hallway Full Bathroom with Shower<br>-Living room with wine cooler, ice maker & wet bar + Flat Screen TV.<br><br>4th Floor:<br>-Crows nest with incredible view of the Gulf. <br><br> For more information about public beach access points you can visit",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
